      en: ["The fortress was constructed in the 1730s.", "The outer walls have a total length of more than 2 kilometers.", "Nadir Shah was the founder of the Afsharid dynasty in Persia.", "A separate citadel for the ruler was located within the fortress walls.", "The facility served as a headquarters during military campaigns against Khiva and Bukhara.", "The fortress is situated along one of the historical branches of the Silk Road."],
